@page "/architect"

<PageTitle>The Architect</PageTitle>


<!-- Page Header -->
<section class="hero fade-in" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <div class="terminal-status">> EXECUTING: /the-architect</div>
    <h1 class="main-heading">The Architectural <strong>Advantage.</strong></h1>
    <p class="sub-heading">
        Uncompromising precision. Zero agency bloat. Delivering enterprise-grade software architecture directly from the source.
    </p>
</section>

<!-- Main Content Grid -->
<section class="architect-grid">

    <!-- Left Column: The Ethos -->
    <div class="bio-text fade-in delay-1">
        <p>
            Enterprise software development often suffers from the "agency illusion"—clients are sold on a vision by senior architects, only to have their core infrastructure handed off to junior developers or layers of non-technical management.
        </p>
        <p>
            BILLENNIUM LIMITED operates differently. Built entirely as a highly specialized, independent consultancy, it guarantees that every architectural decision, every cloud migration strategy, and every line of core backend logic is executed directly by the lead architect.
        </p>

        <p class="highlight">
            > "Direct access means zero signal degradation. When technical challenges arise, there is no communication chain to navigate—only immediate, expert resolution."
        </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Terminal Profile Card -->
    <div class="terminal-card fade-in delay-2">
        <div class="card-header">
            // SYSTEM_ADMIN_PROFILE
        </div>
        <ul class="spec-list">
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> DESIGNATION</span>
                <span class="spec-value">M. Bilen — Director & Senior Software Engineer</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> INCORPORATION_DATE</span>
                <span class="spec-value">10 September 2020</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> OPERATIONAL_BASE</span>
                <span class="spec-value">London, United Kingdom</span>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="spec-label">> CORE_STACK</span>
                <span class="spec-value">.NET, C#, Azure, Microservices, SQL Server</span>
            </li>
           
        </ul>
    </div>

</section>
